Benchmark: B = 2 m square smooth footing, 20 x 20 x 8 m graded domain,
2816 LadrunoUP H8, saturated PDMY (phi = 33 deg nominal), -geom hypo,
drained displacement-controlled push to s/B = 3 % (q = 1337 kPa).

Fields recorded: nodal displacement; per-Gauss-point EFFECTIVE stress
and porePressure. 24 frames.

Note for reading the stress fields: the material's failure surface is a
Drucker-Prager CONE and it mobilises sin(phi) = 0.770 at failure, not
sin(33 deg) = 0.545 -- see vault note 17. Peak mobilisation anywhere in
this run is ~0.69, i.e. ~89 % of strength, and NO element is within 5 %
of failure.

